course: dictionary
lesson: 1
title: Same letters, different meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: One short word can have several meanings, and the context tells you which one is meant. «In a battery such as an AA, two chemicals inside react and push electrons through the wire.» Batteries are mentioned, so AA here is a battery size.
explain: AA is an abbreviation, a short form made from the first letters of longer words. It can stand for the Automobile Association, which helps drivers whose cars break down, or Alcoholics Anonymous, a group that helps people stop drinking alcohol. Read the words around it to decide.
explain: Aa is a different word, a kind of lava. It is said «ah-ah» and comes from Hawaiian. In a volcano lesson, it is contrasted with pahoehoe, which is smooth and ropy. Aa lava cools into rough, sharp lumps. When you see a word you know in a new place, check whether the meaning still fits the sentence.
fact: Context means the words and sentences around a word.
fact: «AA» is most often a battery size, and an AA battery is bigger than an AAA.
fact: «AA» can also be the Automobile Association, which helps drivers whose cars break down.
fact: «Aa» means a kind of lava that cools into rough, sharp, jagged lumps.
fact: Pahoehoe is a different kind of lava, smooth and ropy, so it is the opposite of aa.
exercise: «In a battery such as an AA, two chemicals inside react.» What is an AA in this sentence? | The Automobile Association | Alcoholics Anonymous | *A small cylinder battery | A kind of lava
exercise: In a volcano lesson, aa lava is compared with which other kind? | Snow, which falls from the sky | Sand, which is made of tiny grains | *Pahoehoe, which is smooth and ropy | Ice, which is cold and white
exercise: «The AA came to help the driver whose car had broken down.» What does AA mean here? | *The Automobile Association | An AA battery | Alcoholics Anonymous | A kind of lava
test: «Aa» lava cools into lumps that are what? | Smooth and round | Soft and warm | *Rough, sharp and jagged | Soft and sticky
test: Which is bigger, an AA battery or an AAA battery? | AAA | They are the same size | Neither is a battery | *AA
exam: «The AA came to help the driver whose car had broken down.» Which meaning of AA fits best, and why? | Alcoholics Anonymous, because it helps drivers | An AA battery, because cars need batteries to move | *The Automobile Association, because it helps drivers whose cars break down | A kind of lava, because it cools into lumps
